  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi Transport and Land Compact - Land Project - Land Activity: this Activity aims to support analysis, reform, and implementation of reforms to expand national land-based revenues, address institutional change, and address the land rights records that underpin land institution work. Subactivities include:
(A) Reform of Resourcing and Institutions Sub-Activity
(B) Implementation of Reforms to Resourcing and Institutions Sub-Activity</narrative>
  </description>
